    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, but it's just so exhausting. trying to keep the lights on in rooms that don't even feel like mine anymore. it feels like i'm just fighting a losing battle against a shadow. wouldn't it be easier to just... turn the switch? before the whole place is just empty and cold anyway?",
